sequenceDiagram
    participant EvalHub as eval-hub Orchestrator
    participant ConfigMap as ConfigMap<br/>/etc/eval-job/spec.json
    participant Adapter as Garak Adapter<br/>(K8s Job Pod)
    participant S3 as S3-Compatible Storage<br/>HTTPS
    participant KFP as Kubeflow Pipelines<br/>Server
    participant Pipeline as KFP Pipeline Pods
    participant Model as Target Model<br/>Endpoint
    participant OCI as OCI Registry
    participant Sidecar as eval-hub Sidecar<br/>(Callback)

    Note over EvalHub,Sidecar: Simple Mode Flow
    EvalHub->>ConfigMap: Mount job specification
    Adapter->>ConfigMap: Read /etc/eval-job/spec.json
    Adapter->>Adapter: Resolve credentials<br/>(env vars, mounted files,<br/>eval-hub secrets, fallback)
    Adapter->>Adapter: Redact API keys<br/>from persisted config
    Adapter->>Adapter: Run Garak subprocess<br/>(in-pod)
    Adapter->>Model: Scan probes<br/>Auth: API_KEY / OPENAICOMPATIBLE_API_KEY
    Model-->>Adapter: Model responses
    Adapter->>Adapter: Parse JSONL results
    Adapter->>OCI: Persist scan artifacts
    Adapter->>Sidecar: Report results callback

    Note over EvalHub,Sidecar: KFP Mode Flow
    EvalHub->>ConfigMap: Mount job specification
    Adapter->>ConfigMap: Read /etc/eval-job/spec.json
    Adapter->>Adapter: Resolve credentials<br/>(cascading lookup)
    Adapter->>S3: Upload scan config & prompts<br/>Auth: AWS credentials (envFrom)
    Adapter->>KFP: Submit pipeline<br/>Auth: KFP_AUTH_TOKEN
    KFP->>Pipeline: Create pipeline run
    Note over Pipeline: Step 1: Validation
    Note over Pipeline: Step 2: Taxonomy Resolution
    Note over Pipeline: Step 3: SDG Prompt Generation
    Note over Pipeline: Step 4: Prompt Preparation
    Pipeline->>S3: Read config & prompts<br/>Auth: use_secret_as_env
    Note over Pipeline: Step 5: Garak Scan
    Pipeline->>Model: Scan probes<br/>Auth: API key from secret
    Model-->>Pipeline: Model responses
    Pipeline->>S3: Write JSONL results<br/>Auth: use_secret_as_env
    Note over Pipeline: Step 6: KFP Output Writing
    KFP-->>Adapter: Pipeline complete
    Adapter->>S3: Download scan results
    Adapter->>Adapter: Parse JSONL results
    Adapter->>OCI: Persist scan artifacts
    Adapter->>Sidecar: Report results callback
